"COTEKOREANSTEAKHOUSE.COM","box":[[0.23608017176569107,0.03488372085671798],[0.2316258477826491,0.007267442014482262]]},{"text":"16 W 22ND ST, NY, NY 10010","box":[[0.5389754989686139,0.03488372085771008],[0.1848552379202335,0.007361649639076595]]}],"index":0},{"lines":[{"box":[[0.09576837287847548,0.9273255813313178],[0.062360804131690484,0.007280900246567246]],"text":"EST. 2017"},{"box":[[0.10429555942095553,0.8933167931991784],[0.1878744625876136,0.016355905267927406]],"text":"American Black Angus"},{"box":[[0.3674832952195616,0.9171511629182495],[0.26280623632119904,0.046511628009654804]],"text":"COTE"},{"box":[[0.4253897526234539,0.8923611109334212],[0.14476615148233185,0.01475694444444442]],"text":"American Wagyu"},{"box":[[0.7973273985110663,0.9273255816690453],[0.1069042259919728,0.008727658953931572]],"text":"FLATIRON, NYC"},{"box":[[0.7345415392128462,0.8934364851040498],[0.13663870899389818,0.015063747211738865]],"text":"Japanese Wagyu"},{"text":"Weight: 1,800lbs-2,200lbs","box":[[0.12917594338986252,0.7863372092314759],[0.13585746711027538,0.0073549203850604705]]},{"text":"Source: Specialty farms across the Midwest","box":[[0.08908685842756445,0.7774884258607853],[0.21380846551124086,0.00896990740740744]]},{"text":"\"America's Pride,\" \"The Steakhouse Classic\"","box":[[0.08463251327839094,0.7615740741810271],[0.22717149883297316,0.008774762904202538]]},{"text":"Black Angus is the dominant beet breed in the","box":[[0.08017817029398112,0.7456395348102748],[0.22717149883297322,0.007267442014482262]]},{"text":"US. It is known for producing large muscles","box":[[0.0801781724732833,0.7369186047843554],[0.21380846551124083,0.008741117461963821]]},{"text":"with abundant marbling resulting in high","box":[[0.0801781746637353,0.729651162717772],[0.20044543218950855,0.007328003920890613]]},{"text":"quality meat. We dry age our Prime grade","box":[[0.08017817168902172,0.7209302326916172],[0.20489978113918442,0.008815137600457268]]},{"text":"Black Angus beef in house to maximize its","box":[[0.08225753421683141,0.7123583104778448],[0.20737568199211825,0.010091470347510345]]},{"text":"flavor by expelling water from the subprimals","box":[[0.08017817327661417,0.704861111205404],[0.2227171498832973,0.008801679368372284]]},{"text":"and, through enzmatic process, tenderizing the","box":[[0.0801781725836792,0.697627314856847],[0.2338530087301917,0.00731454568880574]]},{"text":"beef from within.","box":[[0.07986208062538175,0.6888290020837345],[0.08751367339005706,0.009467835779543354]]},{"text":"Weight: 1,500lbs","box":[[0.45657015850213045,0.786337209576022],[0.08685968277302192,0.008801679368372395]]},{"text":"Source: Nebraska & Georgia","box":[[0.4298440970954569,0.7774884258646123],[0.14253897700749385,0.00896990740740733]]},{"text":"\"The Best of Both Worlds\"","box":[[0.43207127160583486,0.7630208333712811],[0.13808462805781802,0.007328003920890613]]},{"text":"American Wagyu is a hybrid of popular domestic","box":[[0.37849007257224987,0.7442228309609745],[0.23854776477137363,0.01062788345195631]]},{"text":"American breeds such as Black Angus and","box":[[0.3786191569076387,0.7369186047843022],[0.2071269420867271,0.008741117461963932]]},{"text":"Longhorn and the famed Wagyu of Japan. At","box":[[0.37861915671581736,0.7296511630280569],[0.2182628009336215,0.008774762904202538]]},{"text":"best we feel that this can offer the best of both","box":[[0.3786191555217687,0.7223837208567518],[0.22939865978051588,0.007361649639076706]]},{"text":"worlds -- the bold, muscular meat of American","box":[[0.37861914726680457,0.7135416665354641],[0.23162584778264905,0.00752314814814814]]},{"text":"cattle tempered by the rich yet delicate marbling","box":[[0.37861915456157325,0.7048611112445591],[0.24053451862741027,0.008801679368372284]]},{"text":"or Japanese Deet. vve source our all natural","box":[[0.3786191569088492,0.6990740741149482],[0.207126942086727,0.004414297916271126]]},{"text":"American Wagyu from a single producer.","box":[[0.37861915455430717,0.688946759254211],[0.2004454321895085,0.008727659229878948]]},{"text":"The Cuts","box":[[0.44739780033956916,0.6589015543391142],[0.0963334901958493,0.01447979829929491]]},{"text":"1 COTE Galbi","box":[[0.4164123695795229,0.6116842657865327],[0.09145142846073662,0.012096584947020927]]},{"text":"Weight: 1,100lbs-1,200lbs","box":[[0.7394209367317294,0.786337209231582],[0.12917594368576157,0.0073549203850604705]]},{"text":"Source: Kagoshima & Miyazaki prefecture","box":[[0.7015590179198615,0.7774884258638847],[0.2048997811391844,0.00896990740740733]]},{"text":"Wagyu translates into \"Japanese cattle\"","box":[[0.6903131964119162,0.7442941380005219],[0.19180792950569325,0.010156035423278698]]},{"text":"and beef produced there is the rarest and","box":[[0.6904231620405503,0.7383720929505222],[0.2026726066643465,0.007287629224635994]]},{"text":"most expensive on earth. Ihrough dilligent","box":[[0.6904231643250082,0.7296511627175548],[0.209354116561565,0.007328003920890613]]},{"text":"breeding and farming practices the Japanese","box":[[0.6904231650872734,0.7223837208581344],[0.21826280093362138,0.007361649639076595]]},{"text":"have developed beef with the most abundant","box":[[0.6904231636309369,0.7135416665356096],[0.22048997540845938,0.00752314814814814]]},{"text":"marbling of any breed. The resulting meat is","box":[[0.6904231612517344,0.7063078704669741],[0.21380846551124089,0.005901431871785157]]},{"text":"astonishingly tender and toothsome, truly a","box":[[0.6904231613362565,0.6976273148573122],[0.21380846551124089,0.00731454568880574]]},{"text":"luxury experience.","box":[[0.6904231615765156,0.6918402778033634],[0.08908685724785981,0.00438065247403252]]},{"text":"1 COTE Steak","box":[[0.6836704231361118,0.6116754971763814],[0.09145648090551939,0.01211412250995636]]},{"text":"3 Skirt Steak","box":[[0.16475954592083883,0.4765878038829299],[0.08250763399381164,0.011940671337975495]]},{"text":"A \"The Flatiron","box":[[0.4264690533178346,0.47577593388501704],[0.10468608098672638,0.018378353781170254]]},{"text":"© Hanger Steak","box":[[0.6836687968805389,0.47648296538133783],[0.09591407640605953,0.01215034833660833]]},{"text":"• Tenderloin I Filet Mignon","box":[[0.15812917588209394,0.35755813953099347],[0.15144766137955037,0.01165482346658353]]},{"text":"F NY Strip I Sirloin ®","box":[[0.4296430475833342,0.35767500779658257],[0.1252173430530738,0.012759917864093029]]},{"text":"3 Ribsteak | Bone-in Ribeye®","box":[[0.6852964634254063,0.35718241471483814],[0.16848343653036346,0.016679488398410602]]},{"text":"At Cote we are proud to only serve the best of","box":[[0.09131403004577444,0.21788194444152098],[0.2338530087301917,0.00752314814814814]]},{"text":"the best - the very pinnacle of beet. Whether we","box":[[0.09131403531597425,0.20920138890518436],[0.23608016967773438,0.007368378617145455]]},{"text":"are talking about domestic, hybrid, or imported, we","box":[[0.08908686537983362,0.20052083330164217],[0.2538975384218473,0.008781492158218662]]},{"text":"only serve the highest grade of that beef available.","box":[[0.09131403998238241,0.19328703702195138],[0.24276167957495287,0.008747846715980168]]},{"text":"Domestically that means Prime grade, which","box":[[0.09118305910005149,0.18104525339118893],[0.2185387171752064,0.010622251916814651]]},{"text":"accounts for only 5% of American beef production.","box":[[0.09131403466487906,0.17441860457927216],[0.24721602852462873,0.007294358478652119]]},{"text":"Our Black Angus beef has been certified by","box":[[0.09118607642951389,0.16449581022733484],[0.21181920910557955,0.01017375566341261]]},{"text":"the US Department of Agriculture to be of the","box":[[0.08908686153172288,0.15843023248483878],[0.22939865978051585,0.007368378617145455]]},{"text":"highest standard. Prime beet must be from young","box":[[0.08908685785854226,0.14959490741715842],[0.2449888675770861,0.00752314814814814]]},{"text":"cattle and exhibit abundant marbling. We further","box":[[0.09131402706207069,0.14236111099942328],[0.2383073576798676,0.007348191406991722]]},{"text":"enhance it by dry aging select cuts in-house, just","box":[[0.09131402706207072,0.13368055546275548],[0.2383073576798676,0.007307816710737103]]},{"text":"like an old school steakhouse.","box":[[0.0890868625789637,0.12644675932400362],[0.1469933124298745,0.00727417099255101]]},{"text":"• Aged 45 days inour dry aging room","box":[[0.7951002225069882,0.24854651156487428],[0.13140311816059969,0.007267442014482262]]},{"text":"Only the Pinnacle of Beef","box":[[0.36748329896554077,0.23546511633736034],[0.25835188737152315,0.015988371990345196]]},{"text":"Our imported Japanese Wagyu is even more","box":[[0.659242758923579,0.2164351850489804],[0.21603563998607878,0.007523148148148251]]},{"text":"stringently graded, using the complex Japanese","box":[[0.659242755210383,0.20775462972343772],[0.23162584778264905,0.008815137600457268]]},{"text":"system that takes in to account such criteria as","box":[[0.6592427635358742,0.20052083336945759],[0.22939865978051577,0.007328003920890724]]},{"text":"muscle contormity, the coror of tne meat, and","box":[[0.659242761249888,0.19328703709055628],[0.22271714988329738,0.004387381452101269]]},{"text":"the quality & luster of fat. In fact the Japanese","box":[[0.6592427597360347,0.1845930231831313],[0.22494432435813527,0.007267442014482373]]},{"text":"use a separate grading system just to measure","box":[[0.6592427597585715,0.17587209294984496],[0.22494432435813527,0.007287629224635883]]},{"text":"intramuscular fat (the fat within the muscle) called","box":[[0.6592427582678787,0.16860465143648706],[0.24498886757708604,0.008768033650186413]]},{"text":"the Beef Marbling Score (BMS). Things get pretty","box":[[0.6590553200253394,0.1577761051242922],[0.24536460173045493,0.012964650436683933]]},{"text":"complicated, but we saved you the trouble - we only","box":[[0.6592427674403807,0.1524884259295236],[0.25389753842184726,0.00752314814814814]]},{"text":"source A5, the highest grade, with marbling scores","box":[[0.659242765135337,0.14380787039292586],[0.24721602852462876,0.0073549203850604705]]},{"text":"of 8 - 12 (the highest grade).","box":[[0.6592427585344962,0.13512731479037776],[0.13585746711027535,0.00876803392613379]]},{"text":"Whether domestic or Japanese, or something","box":[[0.6592427612452482,0.12499999992677657],[0.22271714988329727,0.007267442014482262]]},{"text":"in-between like our American Wagyu, you can be","box":[[0.6592427660210685,0.11773255814119232],[0.23608016967773438,0.005820682479275585]]},{"text":"assured that you are getting the finest beef on earth.","box":[[0.6592427591701064,0.1075581396670563],[0.25612472642398054,0.008761304672117554]]},{"text":"Our Promise Of Quality.","box":[[0.42967365576002764,0.07837714226028847],[0.12732917028115992,0.010284576151106117]]},{"text":"If any of our cuts do not meet your expectations, our team is committed to making it right.","box":[[0.2739420904773387,0.07118055546113944],[0.4387527898693761,0.007307816710736992]]},{"text":"Branding & Menu Design by Pentagram","box":[[0.772828505439235,0.07986111100118853],[0.14476615148233196,0.007348191406991833]]},{"box":[[0.7906458790564882,0.0755208333042745],[0.10690423275562044,0.002967538794985569]],"text":"mustrations Dy rona otacho"},{"box":[[0.22717149106813184,0.04505813946136916],[0.2338530087301917,0.007267442014482262]],"text":"COTEKOREANSTEAKHOUSE.COM"},{"box":[[0.5367483289691002,0.04360465129652147],[0.18262806344539562,0.00876803392613379]],"text":"16 W 22ND ST, NY, NY 10010"}],"index":1,"id":"5D103214-C180-4306-BE09-DF66FE703F6E"}]